          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahenda hivyo mana walonda kuhuonyesa vira ahendavyo kaziye chiajabu. Wahutsambula hosi, Ayahudi na hata asio kala Ayahudi, ili ahuonere mbazi, mana wahutayarisha kare kuphaha nguma phamwenga naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.23+ROM.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.23",
              "ROM.9.24"
            ]
          }
