          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dze, gano gosi manage nini? Manage ni, atu ambao sio Ayahudi taayadzishuulisha kuphaha haki, ela Mlungu waahenda akale na haki kpwa kumkuluphira bahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piya manage ni, Aiziraeli ambao ahenda chadi kulunga Shariya ili aphahe haki, taayaiphaha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa utu wani taayaiphaha? Kpwa sababu aadamira mahendo gao badala ya kumkuluphira Mlungu. Phahi achikpwala rira dziwe kulu na achigbwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
